-9acf-5c7831ccd2d3","position":{"commit_sha":"5fd89dca20337b9700772f58254d872c34145232","position":"1788574760949352001-8e7b7ddb-adb1-46e6-9acf-5c7831ccd2d3"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788570509261138566,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"8d46067e-b12e-4cb2-bd13-4a8be426a72f","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"dd8b-d69a-57af-4f12"},{"link_uuid":"8e7b7ddb-adb1-46e6-9acf-5c7831ccd2d3","relation":"supersedes","target_id":"7232-87d8-7f73-4410"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe infra/nginx cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `infra/nginx/mcp-upstream.conf:1-12` — Preserve committed seed, generated live include, host-nginx glob consumer, safe default upstream. Consumer: nginx/materializer.\n- `infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template:1-37,44-53,89-201,249-300` — Preserve TLS/HSTS, switchable MCP upstream, literal forwarded scheme, prefix/redirect rewriting, op-cert guard, SSE buffering/timeouts, RFC 9728 metadata, Gerrit proxy behavior. Consumer: nginx/operators/security review.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"infra/nginx/mcp-upstream.conf","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"infra/nginx/rebar.conf.template","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"49ac-d7e5-f383-4d7f","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"36f4-ae53-2199-42c1","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in infra/nginx","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["4e6e21c8-cd3b-4ebb-9bb2-6836a933dc8c","ed7422c9-c883-464b-aff7-4e400690573b","8d46067e-b12e-4cb2-bd13-4a8be426a72f","8e7b7ddb-adb1-46e6-9acf-5c7831ccd2d3"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788582561412670001,"uuid":"2d0732d2-90f2-4ffa-ba7d-9ee32b947c18"}